Arte / Art assets

The mascot artwork (everything under `mascotes/`, `assets/` and `build/`) was
generated with AI tools and is released under the same MIT terms as the code,
so anyone may use, modify and redistribute it, including commercially.

Observação (PT-BR): a arte dos mascotes (pastas `mascotes/`, `assets/` e
`build/`) foi gerada por IA e é liberada sob os mesmos termos MIT do código:
qualquer pessoa pode usar, modificar e redistribuir, inclusive comercialmente.
